; Application theories: proofs about SPECIFIC programs (wc, the HTTP/1.0 server, the
; concurrent HTTP driver) built WITH the generic Rocqeteer library. Deliberately NOT
; installed (no (package ...)): the installed `rocqeteer` Rocq theory stays a
; domain-independent library — applications live here, out of it.
(rocq.theory
 (name RocqeteerApps)
 (theories Rocqeteer Stdlib))
